Cross Trevils was a broad, rock-skinned oread dwarf with moss growing along his jawline and soil permanently lodged under his nails, who wore a formal suit woven from living organic fiber. He was a member of [[Org/Verdant Holdings/index|Verdant Holdings]].

He died at the banquet the evening the [[Org/The Harlequins/Providence|Providence]] left [[Geography/Calaria/Ragged Roost|Ragged Roost]], when a barghest out of the tear in the dance floor bit a chunk of stone from his chest.
